Falling Leaves for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of Falling Leaves (2.0.8) by Fourmisain, BrekiTomasson, and RandomMcSomethin.
Original source: https://github.com/Fourmisain/fallingleaves
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: the wind simulation, particle physics, spawning rules,
and configuration are implemented in Rust on Sunrise's typed mod API (no Java code is
included). The leaf, conifer, and snowflake particle textures, mod icon, and translation
files under assets/fallingleaves/ are carried from the original MIT-licensed repository.
This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text
is in LICENSE.
